// "Forêt Frimousse": a forest of giant mushrooms (issue #110, the 9th circuit), after the guide
// « Conception des circuits » (docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1330 m a lap,
// turning right: the start straight on a mossy ridge, 10 m above the forest floor; three hairpins
// (right, left, right) up to the crest, then an S and a drop (issue #221: 44 m up, 14 m before, the
// climbs between the hairpins in anti-gravity); along the crest, 40 m up, to the risky jump's
// corner (a tight corner to the right, its inside a drop, that a ramp crosses); down the slope in
// anti-gravity (a tight corner, a trick ramp), a hairpin to the left down to the stream: the ford,
// under its water, the bison that guards it; a hairpin to the right out of the stream, back up to
// the ridge; the bulge round a giant pine, whose hidden road runs straight behind a waterfall; the
// last corner, that the grass bridge crosses behind a curtain of ferns. Five hairpins of 180° (a
// Normal bot drifts them), the bulge's S (right 150° between two left 75°), four tight corners of
// 90°, an S: no long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts (the jump's corner
// and its landing; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the Corniche Cannelle's (issues
// #107, #156: their gains and their hiding were tuned), with other covers; the rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Forêt Frimousse",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the undergrowth of giant mushrooms (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the
    // same every time (seed), and pieces placed by hand: checkered flags at the start line, a
    // giant pine that hides the hidden road, a giant mushroom by the jump's corner.
    biome: "Sous-bois",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "strange-factory",
    decor_seed: 110,
    // Issue #211: the forest's terrain (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), and it hugs the road: the mossy
    // ridge, 10 to 14 m above the forest floor, is a real ridge up to its walls, which falls away
    // from them (`embank`, rise over run: about 31°), instead of the skirts down to the floor. The
    // voids stay (the jump's corner: 6 m under the road at least); the ford keeps its ground.
    // Issue #221: the road climbs from the stream (-2 m) to the crest, 44 m up (14 m before), and
    // its hills are 50 m high (36 m before), above the crest.
    terrain: (height: 50.0, scale: 130.0, floor: 0.3,
              rock: (0.40, 0.36, 0.30), steep: 1.0, embank: 0.6),
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.0, radius: 0.9, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "nature-kit/tree_pineTallC_detailed", at: 142.216, side: Right, height: 24.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 8.0),
        (model: "nature-kit/mushroom_redTall", at: 76.204, side: Left, height: 16.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 2.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
    points: [
        (pos: (0.00, 10.00, 0.00), width: 15.0, shoulder: 3.0),
